# An allowlist, not a blacklist: everything is excluded unless it is
# named below, so a build from a working tree holding .env, a session
# file or the vault password cannot pick them up either — the image
# contains nothing the repository does not track.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!.python-version
!README.md
!alembic.ini
!src
!src/**
